{"parse": {"title": "LPdF-11", "pageid": 114326, "text": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><div class=\"tabber no-indent\"><div class=\"episode-inter-nav\"><a href=\"/wiki/LPdF-10\" title=\"LPdF-10\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a><span class=\"nav-page-name\">LPdF-11</span><a href=\"/wiki/LPdF-12\" title=\"LPdF-12\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" class=\"img-rotate\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a></div><div class=\"episode-panel\"><div style=\"position: relative; padding-left: 35px;\"><div class=\"episode-deco\"><div class=\"episode-deco-1\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-2\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-3\"></div></div><div class=\"episode-index\"><span class=\"episode-index-chapter\">LPdF</span><span class=\"episode-index-number\">11</span></div><h2 style=\"position:absolute; opacity:0; pointer-events:none;width:0; height:0; overflow:hidden;\"><span id=\".E6.98.A5\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"春\">春</span></h2><div class=\"episode-title\"> 春</div><div class=\"episode-subtitle\">Primavera</div></div><div><div class=\"episode-navbar\"><div class=\"tabber-filter auto-first\" style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; margin: 0 -4px;\"></div></div></div></div><div class=\"episode-switchbtn\"><small style=\"color: #999;\">头像 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small> <small style=\"color: #999;\">背景图 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small></div><div class=\"episode-desc\"><div style=\"display:flex;\"><div style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span class=\"color-value\"></span>那<span class=\"color-value\"></span>是<span class=\"color-value\"></span>盛<span class=\"color-value\"></span>年<span class=\"color-value\"></span>的<span class=\"color-value\"></span>黄<span class=\"color-value\"></span>昏<span class=\"color-value\"></span>—<span class=\"color-value\"></span>—<span class=\"color-value\"></span></div><div class=\"grey-small hide-m\" style=\"float:right;\">ID: 30510111</div></div></div><div class=\"battle-panel\"><div class=\"story no-indent\"><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-s01_bg_05.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"s01_bg_05\"><img alt=\"s01_bg_05\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5a/Cg-s01_bg_05.png/600px-Cg-s01_bg_05.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5a/Cg-s01_bg_05.png/900px-Cg-s01_bg_05.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5a/Cg-s01_bg_05.png/1200px-Cg-s01_bg_05.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">APPLe：</div><div>真令人感动，再也没有那些烦人的天使和云朵了……我从未像现在这样热爱这个世界。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">APPLe：</div><div>维尔汀，刚才你之所以配合神父，是算准了艾吉奥先生一定会回来吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>并不全是。只是……我不能拿苏芙比小姐和莱昂纳多先生的安危冒险。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>更何况，我已经大致猜到了所谓“遗物”的来龙去脉……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>灰褐色的虚影在窗外一晃而过。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">APPLe：</div><div>嗯？这似曾相识的声音，难道……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">艾吉奥：</div><div>我去看看。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>又一只可怜而笨拙的小鸟，捎带着造主的加密讯息。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"312301.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c9/HeadIconSmall-312301.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-312301.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"312301.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c9/HeadIconSmall-312301.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-312301.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c9/HeadIconSmall-312301.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-312301.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">艾吉奥：</div><div>Sicuro……是“安全”的意思。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"312314.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d4/HeadIconSmall-312314.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-312314.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"312314.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d4/HeadIconSmall-312314.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-312314.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d4/HeadIconSmall-312314.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-312314.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">艾吉奥：</div><div>看来我在小偷公会的朋友已经救出了莱昂纳多和苏芙比小姐。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>小偷公会？你结交了不少有趣的朋友。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>我以为刺客都是孤独的。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>艾吉奥笑着摇了摇头。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">艾吉奥：</div><div>恰恰相反。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">艾吉奥：</div><div>你可以把“刺客”理解成一种信念。关于自由、关于反抗压迫的信念。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">艾吉奥：</div><div>我们不属于任何君主、教会，甚至不属于任何文明。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">艾吉奥：</div><div>这样的信念为我们带来了许多同路人，因此我们从不孤单。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>……就像这些画师一样。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>我想，他们也一定视彼此为绘画道路上的同路人。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>一时间，所有人都看向眼前斑驳的壁画，不再言语。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">APPLe：</div><div>所以……综合前面的推理分析，故事的雏形应该很清楚了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>散落在历史一隅的故事正在被一一拾起。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>它们本该和那些落叶、尘埃一样，被吹散在岁月的风中。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>如果被解读是它们注定的命运，那么是了——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>现在便是那个时刻。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-s01_cg_09.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"s01_cg_09\"><img alt=\"s01_cg_09\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/13/Cg-s01_cg_09.png/600px-Cg-s01_cg_09.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/13/Cg-s01_cg_09.png/900px-Cg-s01_cg_09.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/13/Cg-s01_cg_09.png/1200px-Cg-s01_cg_09.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">APPLe：</div><div>大约20年前，乌切洛和其他画师参与了这里的壁画工程。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">APPLe：</div><div>也许赞助人为他们许诺了什么，想必他们当时十分热情洋溢……</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-s01_bg_05.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"s01_bg_05\"><img alt=\"s01_bg_05\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5a/Cg-s01_bg_05.png/600px-Cg-s01_bg_05.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5a/Cg-s01_bg_05.png/900px-Cg-s01_bg_05.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5a/Cg-s01_bg_05.png/1200px-Cg-s01_bg_05.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"636101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5a/HeadIconSmall-636101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-636101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"636101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5a/HeadIconSmall-636101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-636101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5a/HeadIconSmall-636101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-636101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">画师Ⅰ：</div><div>在我看来，透视的精髓不仅在于重现真实，还在于空间的叙事性！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"636201.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/ce/HeadIconSmall-636201.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-636201.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"636201.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/ce/HeadIconSmall-636201.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-636201.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/ce/HeadIconSmall-636201.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-636201.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">画师Ⅱ：</div><div>呵呵，你只看到了皮毛。想要理解透视的精髓，建议你先通读一遍柏拉图。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"636201.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/ce/HeadIconSmall-636201.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-636201.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"636201.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/ce/HeadIconSmall-636201.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-636201.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/ce/HeadIconSmall-636201.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-636201.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">画师Ⅱ：</div><div>我们画家正在做的，不是复制自然，而是通过创造“理想形态”来让观者看到“理念”本身……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"636001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c9/HeadIconSmall-636001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-636001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"636001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c9/HeadIconSmall-636001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-636001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c9/HeadIconSmall-636001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-636001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">女画师：</div><div>真叫人羡慕啊。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"636001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c9/HeadIconSmall-636001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-636001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"636001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c9/HeadIconSmall-636001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-636001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c9/HeadIconSmall-636001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-636001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">女画师：</div><div>他们知道得可真多，不像我……我一见到那些辅助线就头晕。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"630001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/23/HeadIconSmall-630001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-630001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"630001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/23/HeadIconSmall-630001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-630001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/23/HeadIconSmall-630001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-630001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">乌切洛：</div><div>啧！透视算什么，让我来变个小小的魔法——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">APPLe：</div><div>注意：此处乌切洛举起玻璃片，为大家展示了神奇的光学奇迹。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"636101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5a/HeadIconSmall-636101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-636101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"636101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5a/HeadIconSmall-636101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-636101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5a/HeadIconSmall-636101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-636101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">画师Ⅰ：</div><div>乌切洛，你又用那该死的颜料偷偷改了我们的画！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"636101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5a/HeadIconSmall-636101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-636101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"636101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5a/HeadIconSmall-636101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-636101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5a/HeadIconSmall-636101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-636101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">画师Ⅰ：</div><div>现在全乱套了，没有一个地方是按照老爷们的要求来的！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"630001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/23/HeadIconSmall-630001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-630001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"630001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/23/HeadIconSmall-630001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-630001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/23/HeadIconSmall-630001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-630001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">乌切洛：</div><div>嗯哼～！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"636201.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/ce/HeadIconSmall-636201.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-636201.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"636201.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/ce/HeadIconSmall-636201.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-636201.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/ce/HeadIconSmall-636201.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-636201.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">画师Ⅱ：</div><div>咦……修改后的色彩和线条反倒更有生命力了。我赞成这项改动！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"513801.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fe/HeadIconSmall-513801.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-513801.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"513801.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fe/HeadIconSmall-513801.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-513801.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fe/HeadIconSmall-513801.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-513801.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">画师Ⅲ：</div><div>我也赞成！反正那些家伙又看不到我们悄悄画了什么……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"636001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c9/HeadIconSmall-636001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-636001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"636001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c9/HeadIconSmall-636001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-636001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c9/HeadIconSmall-636001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-636001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">女画师：</div><div>原来画画也可以这么自由。谢谢你，乌切洛。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"630001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/23/HeadIconSmall-630001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-630001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"630001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/23/HeadIconSmall-630001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-630001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/23/HeadIconSmall-630001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-630001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">乌切洛：</div><div>咦？画画本来就是一件很自由的事呀！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>他们度过了一段快乐的时光。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>很可惜，快乐的时光总是短暂的。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"560901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9f/HeadIconSmall-560901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-560901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"560901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9f/HeadIconSmall-560901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-560901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9f/HeadIconSmall-560901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-560901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">行会官员：</div><div>很遗憾，因为预算有限，我们不得不中止对这项壁画工程的赞助。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">APPLe：</div><div>不知道是出于什么原因，这些画师工匠们被粗暴地赶出了大教堂。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">APPLe：</div><div>他们似乎没有任何反抗与申辩的机会。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>没有工钱，也没有留下任何书面记录。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">APPLe：</div><div>生活继续前行。画师工匠们流落到不同的项目打零工，就像是旧时代的吉普赛人。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">APPLe：</div><div>然而，那幅未完的壁画依旧牵动着所有人的心。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"636001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c9/HeadIconSmall-636001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-636001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"636001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c9/HeadIconSmall-636001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-636001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c9/HeadIconSmall-636001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-636001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">女画师：</div><div>那天晚上，我一个人悄悄回来了。让我没想到的是，乌切洛竟然也在这里。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"636001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c9/HeadIconSmall-636001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-636001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"636001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c9/HeadIconSmall-636001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-636001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c9/HeadIconSmall-636001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-636001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">女画师：</div><div>还有其他同伴……他们都陆陆续续来了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"636001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c9/HeadIconSmall-636001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-636001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"636001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c9/HeadIconSmall-636001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-636001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c9/HeadIconSmall-636001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-636001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">女画师：</div><div>原来，舍不得这里的不止我一个。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">艾吉奥：</div><div>此时乌切洛高高举起了玻璃片，说——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">艾吉奥：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">艾吉奥：</div><div>故事到这里就中断了。接下来……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>刺客捧起金色的苹果，走到壁画前。</div></div></div></div></div></div>", "categories": [{"sortkey": "", "category": "没有战斗的章节", "hidden": true}, {"sortkey": "", "category": "章节"}], "displaytitle": "LPdF-11"}}